  <name>MailPong</name>
  <summary>Email, reimagined as chat.</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      MailPong is a modern, lightweight desktop email client that shows your
      conversations in a chat view, with a focus on resource efficiency and a
      clean user experience.
    </p>
    <p>
      MailPong is in alpha. Expect rough edges and keep backups of important
      mail. It is derived from Aerion by hkdb.
    </p>

    <p>Features:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Multiple email accounts with unified inbox</li>
      <li>Support for Gmail, Outlook, and generic IMAP/SMTP</li>
      <li>Conversation threading</li>
      <li>Rich text WYSIWYG composer with TipTap editor</li>
      <li>Contact sync (CardDAV, Google, Microsoft) for auto-completion</li>
      <li>Dark mode and multiple color themes</li>
      <li>Keyboard-friendly navigation with vim-style shortcuts</li>
      <li>Detachable composer window</li>
      <li>Basic tracking element removal from emails</li>
      <li>PGP and S/MIME support</li>
      <li>Contacts extension (ALPHA)</li>
      <li>Calendar extension (ALPHA)</li>
      <li>Custom OAuth support for generic IMAP, SMTP, CardDAV, and CalDAV</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

